 "title": "India's Historic Chess Olympiad",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "♟️",
 "sentences": [
  "India hosted the 44th Chess Olympiad in 2022.",
  "The event ran from 28 July to 9 August in Chennai.",
  "It was originally planned for Russia, but moved due to the pandemic and the invasion of Ukraine.",
  "A total of 1737 players participated across the Open and Women's events.",
  "Both sections set brand new records for team participation.",
  "This marked the very first time the Chess Olympiad took place in India."
